{1}{Ugggh...please...help me...}{Ugggh...please...help me...}{}{}{}{pf23 1}
{2}{Who are you?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{3}{Hi!  Uh...who you?}{}{-4}{}{10}{}
{10}{I am Ivalde Ingot...master engineer of the Stone Heart Clan...}{I am Ivalde Ingot...master engineer of the Stone Heart Clan...}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Ah.  Veryk Ironwill sent me here to find out what happened to you...}{}{5}{gf3196 0}{20}{}
{12}{Verik send me here to find you!}{}{-4}{gf3196 0}{20}{}
{13}{Ah.  Veryk Ironwill sent me here to find out what happened to you...}{}{5}{gf3196 1}{15}{}
{14}{Verik send me here to find you!}{}{-4}{gf3196 1}{15}{}
{15}{What?  How many damned people did he send out here?  There's already been someone here, asking about what happened.  Too many outlanders for my taste.  [The dwarf starts coughing...he grabs his midsection, wincing.]  Oh, but that hurts!}{What?  How many damned people did he send out here?  There's already been someone here, asking about what happened.  Too many outlanders for my taste.  [The dwarf starts coughing...he grabs his midsection, wincing.]  Oh, but that hurts!}{}{}{}{}
{16}{I see.  Can you tell me what happened here?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{17}{Whut happen here?}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{20}{He did?  Well, it's about time!  I've been sitting here for who knows how long, bledding to death, and bloody Veryk is sitting in Merton's pleasure palace, conferring with everyone under the sun!}{He did?  Well, it's about time!  I've been sitting here for who knows how long, bledding to death, and bloody Veryk is sitting in Merton's pleasure palace, conferring with everyone under the sun!}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Maybe you'll share with me what has happened here, Ivalde?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{22}{Whut happen here, Ee-balde?}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{30}{Well, as you know, we came down here to check out some recent geological anomalies.  We took the elevator down, and we were attacked as soon as we got off!  Evil creatures, and a lot of them...they must've been some sort of magickal beasts, because I felt sick as soon as I pulled out my axe.  As you can see, they made short work of most of us...}{Well, as you know, we came down here to check out some recent geological anomalies.  We took the elevator down, and we were attacked as soon as we got off!  Evil creatures, and a lot of them...they must've been some sort of magickal beasts, because I felt sick as soon as I pulled out my axe.  As you can see, they made short work of most of us...}{}{}{}{}
{31}{What happened then?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{32}{Then whut?}{}{-4}{}{40}{}
{40}{Well...as soon as we were "taken care of", a man in robes appeared and told the beasts to take the elevator's engine.  They tore the machine from it's base and walked away into the mines.  The man in robes followed shortly afterwards...}{Well...as soon as we were "taken care of", a man in robes appeared and told the beasts to take the elevator's engine.  They tore the machine from it's base and walked away into the mines.  The man in robes followed shortly afterwards...}{}{}{}{}
{41}{Strange.  Why would magickal creatures want a steam engine?}{}{5}{}{50}{}
{42}{Why majick monsters want engine?}{}{-4}{}{50}{}
{50}{How the hell would I know?  The only clue I've got is that the man in robes had a limp...I could see that as he was walking away.  And may the gods help him if I ever get my hands in him.  [He starts coughing again, spitting up blood.]  Well...as soon as someone mends my gut...}{How the hell would I know?  The only clue I've got is that the man in robes had a limp...I could see that as he was walking away.  And may the gods help him if I ever get my hands in him.  [He starts coughing again, spitting up blood.]  Well...as soon as someone mends my gut...}{}{}{}{pf11 1, gf3196 1, pf26 1, pf5 1}
{51}{I hope you get the chance.  Good day...}{}{5}{}{}{fl 55}
{52}{Uh...okay!  Buh-bye!}{}{-4}{}{}{fl 55}
{55}{Er...thanks for coming down here, friend.  And don't take you time getting back to Veryk and telling I'm here!  I'm dying, blast it!}{Er...thanks for coming down here, friend.  And don't take you time getting back to Veryk and telling I'm here!  I'm dying, blast it!}{}{}{}{}
{60}{[The spirit stares at you, hatred in its eyes.  It says nothing.]}{[The spirit stares at you, hatred in its eyes.  It says nothing.]}{}{}{}{}
{65}{Ah!  Blood and ashes!  I'm a bloody ghost!}{Ah!  Blood and ashes!  I'm a bloody ghost!}{}{}{}{pf24 1}
{66}{Who are you, spirit?}{}{5}{}{70}{}
{67}{Uh...who you?}{}{-4}{}{70}{}
{70}{I am Ivalde Ingot...master engineer of the Stone Heart Clan.  Of course, now I'm little more than a blasted phantom!  Of all the bloody luck!}{I am Ivalde Ingot...master engineer of the Stone Heart Clan.  Of course, now I'm little more than a blasted phantom!  Of all the bloody luck!}{}{}{}{}
{71}{Veryk Ironwill sent me here to find out what happened to you...}{}{5}{gf3196 0}{75}{}
{72}{Verik send me here to find you!}{}{-4}{gf3196 0}{75}{}
{73}{Veryk Ironwill sent me here to find out what happened to you...}{}{5}{gf3196 1}{80}{}
{74}{Verik send me here to find you!}{}{-4}{gf3196 1}{80}{}
{75}{Really.  Well it looks like you took just a little too long, friend.  Now I'm little more than wormfood.  I REALLY appreciate the effort, though}{Really.  Well it looks like you took just a little too long, friend.  Now I'm little more than wormfood.  I REALLY appreciate the effort, though}{}{}{}{}
{76}{Hmmm.  Well, why don't you tell me what happened here?}{}{5}{}{88}{}
{77}{Uh...sorry.  Whut happen here?}{}{-4}{}{88}{}
{80}{Really.  Well it looks like you took just a little too long, friend.  Now I'm little more than wormfood.  And you're not the first person to come throught here, either.  Looks like I'm quite a popular dwarf.  Or dwarf GHOST, as things stand now...}{Really.  Well it looks like you took just a little too long, friend.  Now I'm little more than wormfood.  And you're not the first person to come throught here, either.  Looks like I'm quite a popular dwarf.  Or dwarf GHOST, as things stand now...}{}{}{}{}
{81}{Hmmm.  Well, why don't you tell me what happened here?}{}{5}{}{88}{}
{82}{Uh...sorry.  Whut happen here?}{}{-4}{}{88}{}
{88}{Well, as you know, we came down here to check out some recent geological anomalies.  We took the elevator down, and we were attacked as soon as we got off!  Evil creatures, and a lot of them...they must've been some sort of magickal beasts, because I felt sick as soon as I pulled out my axe.  As you can see, they made short work of most of us...}{Well, as you know, we came down here to check out some recent geological anomalies.  We took the elevator down, and we were attacked as soon as we got off!  Evil creatures, and a lot of them...they must've been some sort of magickal beasts, because I felt sick as soon as I pulled out my axe.  As you can see, they made short work of most of us...}{}{}{}{}
{89}{What happened then?}{}{5}{}{93}{}
{90}{Then whut?}{}{-4}{}{93}{}
{93}{Well...as soon as we were "taken care of", a man in robes appeared and told the beasts to take the elevator's engine.  They tore the machine from it's base and walked away into the mines.  The man in robes followed shortly afterwards...}{Well...as soon as we were "taken care of", a man in robes appeared and told the beasts to take the elevator's engine.  They tore the machine from it's base and walked away into the mines.  The man in robes followed shortly afterwards...}{}{}{}{}
{94}{Strange.  Why would magickal creatures want a steam engine?}{}{5}{}{98}{}
{95}{Why majick monsters want engine?}{}{-4}{}{98}{}
{98}{How the hell would I know?  The only clue I've got is that the man in robes had a limp...I could see that as he was walking away.  And may the gods help him if I ever get my hands on him.  [He looks down at himself, remembering.]  Well...uh...maybe I'll just haunt him or something...}{How the hell would I know?  The only clue I've got is that the man in robes had a limp...I could see that as he was walking away.  And may the gods help him if I ever get my hands on him.  [He looks down at himself, remembering.]  Well...uh...maybe I'll just haunt him or something...}{}{}{}{pf11 1, pf5 1}
{99}{How did you die, Ivalde?}{}{5}{}{103}{}
{100}{Uh...how you die?}{}{-4}{}{103}{}
{103}{Well...another damned outlander came down here, and just went and killed me.  Not that it was hard work...those damned creatures had pretty much killed me before anyone showed up...}{Well...another damned outlander came down here, and just went and killed me.  Not that it was hard work...those damned creatures had pretty much killed me before anyone showed up...}{}{}{}{gf3196 1, pf30 1}
{104}{So sorry about that.  I must go...}{}{5}{}{}{fl 108}
{105}{Uh...okay.  Gotta go!}{}{-4}{}{}{fl 108}
{108}{Yeah...good riddance to you.  If you see Veryk, tell him I said thanks a lot for letting me die down here...}{Yeah...good riddance to you.  If you see Veryk, tell him I said thanks a lot for letting me die down here...}{}{}{}{}

